</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e7cbdf24-7ad0-11f1-949b-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP24355812686063.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e7cbdf24-7ad0-11f1-949b-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP24355812686063.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">2971b0ae-7acf-11f1-b562-9188a17f314e</guid><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 13:43:17 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e7cbdf24-7ad0-11f1-949b-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP24355812686063.jpg">© 美联社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>日防相：中朝对俄支持与欧洲对乌援助努力相抵，北约与印太四国合作更为必要</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260708-%E6%97%A5%E9%98%B2%E7%9B%B8-%E6%AD%A3%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%9D%E5%AF%B9%E4%BF%84%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E8%80%8C%E4%BD%BF%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E4%B9%8C%E6%8F%B4%E5%8A%A9%E5%8A%AA%E5%8A%9B%E7%9B%B8%E6%8A%B5</link><description>
